# AICC Builder — E2E (hermetic) frontend env
#
# Loaded by `vite` via `--mode e2e` (npm run dev:e2e). It makes the app
# self-contained for Playwright:
#   - VITE_DEV_AUTH=1     -> skips Cognito entirely (services/auth.ts DEV_AUTH_BYPASS).
#                            ONLY active in a dev build (import.meta.env.DEV); never in `vite build`.
#   - VITE_SESSION_API_URL="" -> every DynamoDB REST call early-returns a safe empty value
#                            (services/sessions.ts guards on !SESSION_API_URL), so the
#                            hermetic suite only has to mock the WebSocket + a couple /api/* calls.
#   - Cognito vars blank  -> never used while DEV_AUTH_BYPASS is on.
#
# Nothing here points at a real AWS resource. This file is safe to commit.
VITE_DEV_AUTH=1
VITE_WS_MODE=alb
VITE_SESSION_API_URL=
VITE_USER_POOL_ID=
VITE_USER_POOL_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_IDENTITY_POOL_ID=
VITE_COGNITO_REGION=ap-northeast-2
